  "Developing intelligent solutions using machine learning, computer vision, NLP, and AI integration to address real-world challenges.": "Mengembangkan solusi cerdas dengan machine learning, computer vision, NLP, dan integrasi AI untuk menjawab tantangan dunia nyata.",
