  "Building functional and scalable web applications through frontend development, backend services, REST APIs, database integration, testing, and deployment.": "Membangun aplikasi web yang fungsional dan scalable lewat pengembangan frontend, layanan backend, REST API, integrasi database, testing, dan deployment.",
