  "A full-stack movie discovery and review app: browse TMDB titles, watch trailers, and manage account-based watchlists, ratings, and reviews with a React frontend and Express/PostgreSQL API.": "Aplikasi full-stack untuk menemukan dan mengulas film: jelajahi judul dari TMDB, tonton trailer, dan kelola watchlist, rating, serta ulasan berbasis akun dengan frontend React dan API Express/PostgreSQL.",
  "Show Movie Review": "Tampilkan Movie Review",
  "A source-based OpenMusic REST API with Hapi.js, PostgreSQL, JWT authentication, Redis caching, RabbitMQ export jobs, and an interactive API simulator.": "REST API OpenMusic berbasis source dengan Hapi.js, PostgreSQL, autentikasi JWT, caching Redis, job ekspor RabbitMQ, dan simulator API interaktif.",
  "View BOOKSHELF API": "Lihat BOOKSHELF API",
  "A RESTful Bookshelf API built with Node.js and Express for CRUD operations, query filtering, validation, and consistent JSON responses.": "Bookshelf API RESTful yang dibangun dengan Node.js dan Express untuk operasi CRUD, filter query, validasi, dan respons JSON yang konsisten.",
  "Show BOOKSHELF API": "Tampilkan BOOKSHELF API",
  "Notes Application": "Aplikasi Catatan",
  "View Notes Application": "Lihat Aplikasi Catatan",
  "A React-based notes application for creating, searching, editing, archiving, and managing notes with authentication-oriented flows and API integration.": "Aplikasi catatan berbasis React untuk membuat, mencari, mengedit, mengarsipkan, dan mengelola catatan, dengan alur berorientasi autentikasi dan integrasi API.",
  "Show Notes Application": "Tampilkan Aplikasi Catatan",
  "Full-Stack Engineering · Movie Reviews": "Full-Stack Engineering · Ulasan Film",
  "Find a film, watch the trailer, then rate it, review it and keep a watchlist that follows you to any device. I built both halves: a React app on top of TMDB, and my own Express + PostgreSQL API that handles accounts and your library.": "Cari film, tonton trailer-nya, lalu beri rating, tulis ulasan, dan simpan watchlist yang ikut ke perangkat mana pun. Saya membangun kedua sisinya: aplikasi React di atas TMDB, dan API Express + PostgreSQL buatan sendiri yang mengurus akun dan koleksi Anda.",
  "React · 12 pages": "React · 12 halaman",
  "Express · 16 endpoints": "Express · 16 endpoint",
  "Neon · 4 tables": "Neon · 4 tabel",
  "Integration tests": "Integration test",
  "11 API cases": "11 kasus API",
  "⌘ Architecture": "⌘ Arsitektur",
  "React handles what you see; my Express API handles who you are and what you saved. TMDB supplies titles, posters and trailers, so only ratings, watchlists and reviews live in Neon.": "React mengurus apa yang Anda lihat; API Express saya mengurus siapa Anda dan apa yang Anda simpan. TMDB menyediakan judul, poster, dan trailer, jadi hanya rating, watchlist, dan ulasan yang disimpan di Neon.",
  "⚙ Implemented Features": "⚙ Fitur yang Sudah Dibuat",
  "Frontend · Trending hero and fast browse by genre, rating and year": "Frontend · Hero trending dan penjelajahan cepat berdasarkan genre, rating, dan tahun",
  "Frontend · Live search that waits until you stop typing": "Frontend · Pencarian langsung yang menunggu sampai Anda berhenti mengetik",
  "Frontend · Title page with trailer, cast and similar titles": "Frontend · Halaman judul dengan trailer, pemeran, dan judul serupa",
  "Backend · Sign-up and sign-in with JWT": "Backend · Daftar dan masuk dengan JWT",
  "Backend · Watchlist and ratings saved per account": "Backend · Watchlist dan rating tersimpan per akun",
  "Backend · Public reviews written with an account": "Backend · Ulasan publik yang ditulis dengan akun",
  "Frontend: React, Redux Toolkit, React Router, Axios · Backend: Express, PostgreSQL (Neon), JWT, bcrypt · Deployed on Vercel.": "Frontend: React, Redux Toolkit, React Router, Axios · Backend: Express, PostgreSQL (Neon), JWT, bcrypt · Di-deploy di Vercel.",
  "Movie Review · Live web": "Movie Review · Web live",
  "Movie Review Application live preview": "Pratinjau live aplikasi Movie Review",
  "Under the hood": "Di balik layar",
  "4 sections": "4 bagian",
  "FRONTEND · DATA & SEARCH": "FRONTEND · DATA & PENCARIAN",
  "Custom hooks load data, handle loading and errors, and ignore outdated responses. Search waits until you stop typing. The title page gets cast, trailer and similar titles in a single request.": "Custom hook memuat data, menangani loading dan error, serta mengabaikan respons yang sudah usang. Pencarian menunggu sampai Anda berhenti mengetik. Halaman judul mengambil pemeran, trailer, dan judul serupa dalam satu request.",
  "FRONTEND · STATE & FEEL": "FRONTEND · STATE & KESAN",
  "Changes show instantly and roll back if the server says no. Filters live in the URL, so any view can be shared. Skeletons and retry states cover slow or failed requests.": "Perubahan tampil seketika dan dibatalkan otomatis jika server menolak. Filter tersimpan di URL, jadi setiap tampilan bisa dibagikan. Skeleton dan state retry menangani request yang lambat atau gagal.",
  "BACKEND · API & SECURITY": "BACKEND · API & KEAMANAN",
  "Routes call service and repository layers. Passwords are stored as bcrypt hashes and sign-in returns a JWT; an expired token gets a 401 and the app signs you out. Reviews need an account and stop at 600 characters.": "Route memanggil layer service dan repository. Password disimpan sebagai hash bcrypt dan login mengembalikan JWT; token kedaluwarsa mendapat 401 dan aplikasi mengeluarkan Anda. Ulasan butuh akun dan dibatasi 600 karakter.",
  "BACKEND · DATA & DELIVERY": "BACKEND · DATA & PENGIRIMAN",
  "Four PostgreSQL tables point to titles by (media_type, tmdb_id), so there is no movie copy to keep in sync. A guest's watchlist and ratings are merged into the account at first login. 11 integration tests run against a real database, and the API deploys with the app on Vercel.": "Empat tabel PostgreSQL merujuk judul lewat (media_type, tmdb_id), jadi tidak ada salinan film yang harus disinkronkan. Watchlist dan rating tamu digabung ke akun saat login pertama. 11 integration test berjalan di database sungguhan, dan API di-deploy bersama aplikasi di Vercel.",
  "Live preview unavailable": "Pratinjau live tidak tersedia",
  "The deployment is not responding right now.": "Deployment sedang tidak merespons.",
  "The ASAH capstone concept for banking sales teams: predictive lead scoring, customer segmentation and campaign analytics, from the business case, through six weeks of delivery planning, to the dashboard.": "Konsep capstone ASAH untuk tim sales perbankan: lead scoring prediktif, segmentasi pelanggan, dan analitik kampanye, dari business case, melewati enam minggu perencanaan delivery, sampai dashboard.",
  "Target users, competitor positioning, value proposition, and proposed rollout metrics.": "Target pengguna, posisi kompetitor, value proposition, dan metrik rollout yang diusulkan.",
