  "Why does lead prioritization matter?": "Kenapa prioritas lead itu penting?",
  "The project explores a common outbound banking challenge: broad calling lists and simple demographic grouping may make it harder for sales teams to decide whom to approach first.": "Proyek ini menelusuri tantangan umum di outbound perbankan: daftar telepon yang luas dan pengelompokan demografis sederhana bisa menyulitkan tim sales memutuskan siapa yang dihubungi lebih dulu.",
  "Untargeted outreach": "Outreach tanpa target",
  "Conventional calling strategies can distribute effort across prospects without clear prioritization.": "Strategi telepon konvensional membagi tenaga ke banyak prospek tanpa prioritas yang jelas.",
  "Limited decision context": "Konteks keputusan terbatas",
  "Sales teams need a clearer view of customer characteristics, priority groups, and campaign information.": "Tim sales butuh gambaran yang lebih jelas tentang karakteristik pelanggan, kelompok prioritas, dan informasi kampanye.",
  "Operational inefficiency": "Operasional tidak efisien",
