  "How could a sales team prioritize likely prospects and understand campaign performance without relying only on broad, manual segmentation?": "Bagaimana tim sales bisa memprioritaskan prospek yang paling potensial dan memahami performa kampanye tanpa hanya mengandalkan segmentasi manual yang luas?",
