  "Implemented the React dashboard structure for customer prioritization, probability scores, campaign analytics, and promotion notes using Vite, TailwindCSS, and Recharts.": "Mengimplementasikan struktur dashboard React untuk prioritas pelanggan, skor probabilitas, analitik kampanye, dan catatan promosi memakai Vite, TailwindCSS, dan Recharts.",
