  "Auth & Session": "Auth & Sesi",
  "Login, forgot-password and reset-password pages sit outside the protected routes. Requests carry a Bearer token from AuthContext, and the access token is refreshed through a cookie-based refresh endpoint.": "Halaman login, lupa password, dan reset password berada di luar protected route. Request membawa Bearer token dari AuthContext, dan access token diperbarui lewat endpoint refresh berbasis cookie.",
  "ML & Insight Flow": "Alur ML & Insight",
  "Customer features are posted to the ML endpoint; the client accepts several response shapes, shows the probability score with a colour scale, and saves it to the backend. A separate prompt endpoint returns an AI insight for a customer.": "Fitur pelanggan dikirim ke endpoint ML; klien menerima beberapa bentuk respons, menampilkan skor probabilitas dengan skala warna, lalu menyimpannya ke backend. Endpoint prompt terpisah mengembalikan AI insight untuk pelanggan.",
  "Context providers (auth, customers, dashboard) and hooks keep data logic out of components. A small Express dev server serves sample customers and a health check, and an activity logger keeps recent UI events locally.": "Context provider (auth, pelanggan, dashboard) dan hook menjaga logika data di luar komponen. Server dev Express kecil menyajikan sampel pelanggan dan health check, sedangkan activity logger menyimpan event UI terbaru secara lokal.",
  "An AI-powered web app that monitors focus in real time with computer vision and MediaPipe Face Mesh: the user research and design, the detection model, and the Flask application with spoken alerts and session reports.": "Aplikasi web berbasis AI yang memantau fokus secara real-time dengan computer vision dan MediaPipe Face Mesh: riset dan desain pengguna, model deteksi, serta aplikasi Flask dengan peringatan suara dan laporan sesi.",
